# The introspection snapshot in provider-dev/downloaded/ IS committed: the
# Railway GraphQL schema is served unversioned and the vendor ships
# continuously, so committing the snapshot makes every refresh a reviewable
# diff against the hash pin in provider-dev/config/schema_pin.json.
